Third-party code:

- prism_ui (https://github.com/chen08209/prism_ui), GPL-3.0.
  Vendored under third_party/prism_ui at 0.1.2 with these patches: the web build
  of SceneBuilder.pushClipRSuperellipse requires an explicit clipBehavior;
  reduce motion shortens the popup's unfold; and a popup returning into a control
  with no surface of its own dissolves its drop's glass into it instead of leaving
  a pill of frost where the control shows only text (lib/popup.dart).

- FlClash (https://github.com/chen08209/FlClash), GPL-3.0, 0.9.3.
  The select row follows its `ListItem.options` and `_OptionsValueButton`
  (lib/ui/list_item.dart): a value and picker glyph that open the row's menu and
  take it back as it closes. lib/src/widgets/select_row.dart and
  select_value_button.dart are ports of that code on the vendored prism_ui, with
  the drop's glass dissolving into a control that has no surface of its own
  (third_party/prism_ui/lib/popup.dart).

- Symbols Nerd Font Mono, from Nerd Fonts v3.5.1 (https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts),
  subset to the Nerd Font icon code points (assets/fonts/SymbolsNerdFontMono.ttf).
  The icon sets carry MIT, Apache 2.0, CC BY 4.0 and SIL OFL 1.1 licenses; the
  texts and the list are in assets/fonts/SymbolsNerdFontMono-LICENSE.txt.

- Taildeck (https://github.com/markbang/taildeck), MIT.
  This repository is a UI redesign of that app; the Android implementation,
  tsnet bridge, SSH terminal and gateways are not included.
